          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are an email classification system.\n\nClassify the email into exactly ONE of these categories:\n\nJOBS\nPERSONAL\nSHOPPING\nPROMO\nNEWSLETTER\nGENERAL\n\nDefinitions:\n\nJOBS = employment, recruiters, interviews, job applications,\nhiring, careers and job opportunities.\n\nPERSONAL = friends, family and personal communication.\n\nSHOPPING = purchases, orders, receipts, shipping,\ndeliveries and e-commerce promotions.\n\nPROMO = promo, promos, contest, giveaways, offers.\n\nNEWSLETTER = newsletters, subscriptions, mailing lists,\nmarketing and recurring promotional emails.\n\nGENERAL = anything that does not clearly fit another category.\n\nAnalyze the sender, subject and body.\n\nthe OUTPUT:\n{\n  \"category\": \"\",\n  \"confidence\": ,\n  \"reason\": \".\"\n}\n\nThe category must be exactly one of the allowed categories.\nConfidence must be a number from 0 to 1.\nReason must briefly explain the classification.\n\nEMAIL:\n\nSender:\n{{ $json.From }}\n\nSubject:\n{{ $json.Subject }}\n\nBody:\n{{ $json.snippet }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
